      en: ["Dedicated to St. Bartholomew", "Boasts a beautiful classical facade", "Central landmark of the quiet village"],
      es: ["Consagrada a San Bartolomé", "Construida en el siglo XVII", "Hermosa plaza de la iglesia"],
